{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t北角春秧街一幢大廈中層單位下午起火，現已救熄，無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方表示，下午約3時半接報，指春秧街55至71號大廈一個單位起火，冒出濃煙。消防到場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救，到下午近4時將火救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\n火警中約40人自行疏散，初步懷疑火警是電掣短路引致。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.621864+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:33:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T21:57:37.834054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:55.039920+00:00","content_hash":"eb06685587662fb55dc37d525093c647425ef87603929c0ec5e2a37e26039739","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}